{"ep": "22", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:00.60", "end": "0:00:02.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么就到下一个场面了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:02.49", "end": "0:00:06.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希  你用魔法使劲地攻击实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:10.34", "end": "0:00:12.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这回答当然是「NO！」"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:12.81", "end": "0:00:13.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要说是魔法了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:14.02", "end": "0:00:16.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要是会弄痛朝比奈学姐的行为我也不允许"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:17.14", "end": "0:00:20.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你瞧  朝比奈学姐不是正脸色发青不停地颤抖着吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:29.46", "end": "0:00:32.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  算了  我会在这画面上使用VFX的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:29.46", "end": "0:00:32.86", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（让主角的动作速度变快或放慢的视觉特效技术）"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:33.66", "end": "0:00:37.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  光线从有希的棒子射出来的效果就靠你了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:38.33", "end": "0:00:41.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要怎么做才会有那种视觉效果啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:41.87", "end": "0:00:43.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠要在那里惨叫"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:43.65", "end": "0:00:45.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后就面露痛苦地倒下"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:46.54", "end": "0:00:48.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊～"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 13, "start": "0:02:28.50", "end": "0:02:29.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有鸽子的画面吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 14, "start": "0:02:30.14", "end": "0:02:30.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 15, "start": "0:02:31.21", "end": "0:02:33.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来就到附近的神社去"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 16, "start": "0:02:34.10", "end": "0:02:36.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们要拍下鸽子一下子飞起来的画面"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 17, "start": "0:02:36.70", "end": "0:02:38.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以此为背景实玖瑠就在前面跑"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 18, "start": "0:02:39.68", "end": "0:02:42.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以的话我想全都是白鸽"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 19, "start": "0:02:41.02", "end": "0:02:42.26", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（禁止在此喂养鸽子）"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 20, "start": "0:02:42.51", "end": "0:02:44.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过现在的话什么颜色都好先将就着吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:45.25", "end": "0:02:47.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不懂日语吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 22, "start": "0:02:52.14", "end": "0:02:53.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我到底在拍些什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 23, "start": "0:02:57.93", "end": "0:02:58.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这画面啦  阿虚"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 24, "start": "0:02:59.12", "end": "0:03:00.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要好好地拍下来啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:01.53", "end": "0:03:03.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠你坐着干什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:07.78", "end": "0:03:09.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接招"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:09.64", "end": "0:03:10.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么！"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:12.27", "end": "0:03:13.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "撤退！"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:21.89", "end": "0:03:24.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠啊  你吃得太少了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:25.80", "end": "0:03:27.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样子怎么会长得大呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:28.28", "end": "0:03:32.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "光长胸部只会让核心狂热者…高兴而已哦"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:32.84", "end": "0:03:34.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也要多长高啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:34.54", "end": "0:03:35.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可是知道的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:36.20", "end": "0:03:37.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使不知道还要多少年"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:38.31", "end": "0:03:40.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但朝比奈学姐无论脸蛋还是身材"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:40.29", "end": "0:03:43.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都会成长到足以被选上太阳系小姐代表的水准"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:44.82", "end": "0:03:46.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然她本人貌似不太清楚"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:47.75", "end": "0:03:52.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日  你啊  要是那个神官向学校告状的话怎么办"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:53.06", "end": "0:03:56.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉身上的制服可把我们的身分泄漏出去了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:56.75", "end": "0:03:58.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该没有问题吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:58.62", "end": "0:04:00.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们隔那么远  这种夹克也是满大街的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:01.13", "end": "0:04:03.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他说什么也好  我们打死都不承认就是了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:04.16", "end": "0:04:07.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是这部片子上映的话  不就什么都泄漏出去了吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:08.42", "end": "0:04:11.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在神社里被鸽群围困的女侍"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:11.59", "end": "0:04:13.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这附近也不会有第二位了吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:14.83", "end": "0:04:16.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后呢  下面我们要到哪里？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:17.93", "end": "0:04:20.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们再回到公园的小广场吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:20.73", "end": "0:04:23.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "仔细想想  只有那样的画面不能算战斗啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:24.75", "end": "0:04:28.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拼命往森林里逃跑的实玖瑠与追赶她的有希"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:29.24", "end": "0:04:31.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后  碰巧经过那里的古泉救下了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:32.11", "end": "0:04:34.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从悬崖上掉下去的实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:34.90", "end": "0:04:35.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种发展怎么样啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:36.47", "end": "0:04:38.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这发展可真俗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:39.26", "end": "0:04:40.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但春日的话"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:40.46", "end": "0:04:43.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搞不好会真的会把朝比奈学姐从悬崖上推下去"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:43.88", "end": "0:04:44.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然如此  就换你掉下去吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 57, "start": "0:04:45.40", "end": "0:04:48.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你就作为朝比奈的替身演员穿上这身衣服吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 58, "start": "0:04:48.56", "end": "0:04:51.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然胸部可能有点不够容量"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 59, "start": "0:04:51.64", "end": "0:04:53.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你都在想什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 60, "start": "0:04:53.71", "end": "0:04:57.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难不成是想像我穿女服务员制服的样子吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 61, "start": "0:04:57.75", "end": "0:04:58.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你是读心术者啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 62, "start": "0:04:59.77", "end": "0:05:02.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "登场人物就只有我们三个吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:02.84", "end": "0:05:04.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笨蛋  不要问多余的问题"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:05.42", "end": "0:05:08.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  只有三个人的话可不够啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:08.94", "end": "0:05:11.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你让我觉察到一件好事"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:11.76", "end": "0:05:13.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就增加你的戏份作为回礼吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:15.51", "end": "0:05:17.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那可…谢谢了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:17.68", "end": "0:05:18.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "活该"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:19.54", "end": "0:05:23.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就知道会自寻烦恼  所以才不说出来"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:24.59", "end": "0:05:28.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打倒BOSS之前可是要先打倒一堆杂鱼才行啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:29.32", "end": "0:05:30.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "杂鱼  杂鱼…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:31.15", "end": "0:05:32.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那班家伙可以吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:32.59", "end": "0:05:33.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就这么干吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 74, "start": "0:05:34.15", "end": "0:05:35.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谷口与国木田"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 75, "start": "0:05:35.75", "end": "0:05:39.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他们可是配角中的配角  杂鱼中的杂鱼啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 76, "start": "0:05:39.89", "end": "0:05:43.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之我们先要让实玖瑠吃足苦头"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 77, "start": "0:05:43.85", "end": "0:05:46.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让可怜的少女饱受折磨"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 78, "start": "0:05:47.07", "end": "0:05:49.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最后却迎来happy ending"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 79, "start": "0:05:49.31", "end": "0:05:50.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就是这电影的主题"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 80, "start": "0:05:52.97", "end": "0:05:57.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠越是不幸  最终的情感宣泄就越是爆发"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 81, "start": "0:05:58.93", "end": "0:06:03.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么意思啊  是觉得我靠不住的意思吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:10.51", "end": "0:06:13.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们又一次回到了森林公园"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:16.02", "end": "0:06:17.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们还是放弃用枪吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:19.31", "end": "0:06:21.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本来以为会射出很厉害的子弹的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:21.53", "end": "0:06:23.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没想到既没有熊熊的火焰也没有声音"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:23.73", "end": "0:06:24.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点临场感都没有"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:26.37", "end": "0:06:27.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠站这里"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:30.37", "end": "0:06:31.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希就站在这"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:34.63", "end": "0:06:36.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要离开自己的位置啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:36.43", "end": "0:06:38.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我要拍下你们怒目对视的画面"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:39.73", "end": "0:06:41.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  准备好反光板"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:45.59", "end": "0:06:46.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Action！"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 93, "start": "0:06:47.27", "end": "0:06:47.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 94, "start": "0:06:47.97", "end": "0:06:48.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 95, "start": "0:06:49.68", "end": "0:06:50.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么Action啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 96, "start": "0:06:50.91", "end": "0:06:53.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日  你除了叫她们站着什么都没说啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 97, "start": "0:06:53.86", "end": "0:06:55.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你让她们做出什么Action啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:03.53", "end": "0:07:06.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  这样的话不像战斗啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:06.63", "end": "0:07:07.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为她们只是一味地站着嘛"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:12.52", "end": "0:07:13.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好了  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:13.86", "end": "0:07:17.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算你再怎么可爱  也不能这样就松懈了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:17.46", "end": "0:07:20.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可爱的女孩子可是满大街是啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:21.81", "end": "0:07:22.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果你只是安安稳稳地过日子"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:22.73", "end": "0:07:25.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很快就会被下面的年轻女孩子追过去的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:26.65", "end": "0:07:27.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你到底想说什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:28.17", "end": "0:07:29.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以说  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:29.71", "end": "0:07:31.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "起码从眼中发射出光束啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:33.68", "end": "0:07:34.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是不可能的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:35.10", "end": "0:07:37.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那不同颜色的左眼就是为了这个目的而存在的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:38.34", "end": "0:07:40.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可不是吃饱了撑的让它变成蓝色的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 111, "start": "0:07:40.70", "end": "0:07:43.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可是把它设定成隐藏着惊人威力的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 112, "start": "0:07:43.29", "end": "0:07:47.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就是光束  实玖瑠光束啊  你要发射出这个"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 113, "start": "0:07:47.49", "end": "0:07:48.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "发不出啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 114, "start": "0:07:48.80", "end": "0:07:49.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "使劲发出来吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 115, "start": "0:07:50.38", "end": "0:07:51.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好痛啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 116, "start": "0:07:51.35", "end": "0:07:53.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这笨蛋  停手"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 117, "start": "0:07:54.96", "end": "0:07:55.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你干什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 118, "start": "0:07:56.37", "end": "0:07:58.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你可真是一个不老实的家伙"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:05.16", "end": "0:08:08.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正常人的眼睛会射出光束吗  你傻啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:11.27", "end": "0:08:13.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哼  这种事我还不知道吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:15.45", "end": "0:08:18.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我只是想告诉她要有发出光束的气势"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:19.59", "end": "0:08:21.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为她完全没有主角该有的霸气"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:22.44", "end": "0:08:24.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这家伙也真是不懂得幽默"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:25.61", "end": "0:08:28.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的幽默根本不算是幽默  这才叫人伤脑筋"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:29.07", "end": "0:08:32.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是朝比奈学姐真的有发射激光的机能的话怎么办"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:33.65", "end": "0:08:34.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该不会有吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:40.02", "end": "0:08:44.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种效果在拍完之后以CG处理应该就可以解决了吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:44.89", "end": "0:08:45.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 129, "start": "0:08:46.72", "end": "0:08:47.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说的那由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 130, "start": "0:08:48.14", "end": "0:08:49.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我本来就是这个意思"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 131, "start": "0:08:51.36", "end": "0:08:53.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才的NG  再重拍一遍"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 132, "start": "0:08:54.99", "end": "0:08:57.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你边喊着口号「实玖瑠光束」边做这个动作"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 133, "start": "0:08:58.34", "end": "0:09:00.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这  这样子吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:00.51", "end": "0:09:01.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不对  这样才对"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:02.18", "end": "0:09:03.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有  右眼要闭起来"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:04.17", "end": "0:09:05.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  实玖瑠  你试一下吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:06.96", "end": "0:09:09.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实…实…实玖瑠光束～"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:10.12", "end": "0:09:11.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "声音再大一点"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:12.02", "end": "0:09:13.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠光束～"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:13.98", "end": "0:09:15.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要害羞  再大声一点"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:16.32", "end": "0:09:19.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实…实…实玖瑠光束～"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:19.39", "end": "0:09:20.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要从丹田发声！"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:21.32", "end": "0:09:24.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "旁边一家老少的目光可真够难受的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:24.97", "end": "0:09:27.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  接下来就正式开始吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:35.40", "end": "0:09:36.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从那发射光束吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 146, "start": "0:09:40.75", "end": "0:09:43.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实…实…实玖瑠光束～"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 147, "start": "0:09:45.18", "end": "0:09:45.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 148, "start": "0:09:49.58", "end": "0:09:52.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀  有希  你什么时候到那里去的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:14.35", "end": "0:10:15.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Cut  Cut"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:15.03", "end": "0:10:16.80", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "放手啊  放手啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:17.65", "end": "0:10:19.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下  有希  你在干什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:19.68", "end": "0:10:21.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在干什么啊  喂  长门"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:19.87", "end": "0:10:21.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有这样的戏啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:30.00", "end": "0:10:30.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你没事吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:33.06", "end": "0:10:33.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:33.99", "end": "0:10:35.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  你们两个都在干什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:36.15", "end": "0:10:38.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要做剧本里面没有的事情啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:38.78", "end": "0:10:41.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？实玖瑠你的隐形眼镜哪里去了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:42.32", "end": "0:10:44.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  奇怪…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:44.66", "end": "0:10:48.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种时候只能去问掌握整个情况的人了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:49.28", "end": "0:10:52.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你有没有看到朝比奈学姐的有色隐形眼镜啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:53.05", "end": "0:10:53.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:53.83", "end": "0:10:54.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说谎"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:54.45", "end": "0:10:56.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是刚刚的战斗中掉了吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:56.96", "end": "0:10:58.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么哪里都找不到呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:00.57", "end": "0:11:02.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也装着来找一下吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:03.66", "end": "0:11:06.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可能是因为风吹断的  太轻了吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:07.41", "end": "0:11:09.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  断了吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:11.14", "end": "0:11:12.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "便宜没好货呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:13.36", "end": "0:11:15.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉  学校的摄影部就只会卖一些烂东西"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:16.82", "end": "0:11:19.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你用胶带从后面贴起来"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:20.04", "end": "0:11:20.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:22.82", "end": "0:11:26.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有了隐形眼镜  影像可就连不起来了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:26.31", "end": "0:11:27.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么办呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:30.87", "end": "0:11:34.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对了  那就设定为变身之后眼珠的颜色才会改变"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:35.44", "end": "0:11:36.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "变  变身？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:36.77", "end": "0:11:41.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对呀  如果是平常就这种穿着那也不够现实"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:42.37", "end": "0:11:45.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在虚构的故事当中寻求真实感的人脑袋一定有问题"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:45.85", "end": "0:11:47.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不…不错啊  那个"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:48.39", "end": "0:11:51.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好想穿正常点的衣服啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 181, "start": "0:11:52.21", "end": "0:11:55.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  实玖瑠平时的装扮就是兔女郎装"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 182, "start": "0:11:56.61", "end": "0:11:58.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为为为为为为为什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 183, "start": "0:11:59.04", "end": "0:12:01.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我只拿了那个啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:01.75", "end": "0:12:05.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真要是用便装的话  画面就一点都不华丽了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:05.51", "end": "0:12:06.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:06.18", "end": "0:12:06.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等下"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:07.04", "end": "0:12:08.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我正在考虑设定"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:09.55", "end": "0:12:10.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说呐"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:10.50", "end": "0:12:14.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠的通常形态是商店街招揽客人的兔女郎哟"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:15.07", "end": "0:12:20.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "察觉到危机时便立刻变身  变成战斗女侍"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:20.36", "end": "0:12:21.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么样  很完美吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:22.03", "end": "0:12:24.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才不是在说现实什么的吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:24.60", "end": "0:12:25.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那  快点换吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:25.84", "end": "0:12:26.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "痛痛痛痛痛…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:30.21", "end": "0:12:31.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要您如此付出  辛苦了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:32.60", "end": "0:12:35.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  那是什么即兴表演啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:39.24", "end": "0:12:39.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:42.26", "end": "0:12:44.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然是你偷的啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:45.61", "end": "0:12:46.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "镭射"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 200, "start": "0:12:49.38", "end": "0:12:50.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  长门？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 201, "start": "0:12:50.49", "end": "0:12:51.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我一直在想"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 202, "start": "0:12:51.95", "end": "0:12:54.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的说明连最低限度需要说的都没有啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 203, "start": "0:12:55.24", "end": "0:12:56.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至少说10秒吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 204, "start": "0:12:58.42", "end": "0:13:01.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "具有高指向性的  带宽不可视的可干涉性光"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:02.54", "end": "0:13:05.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此  是具有高指向性的不可视…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:06.15", "end": "0:13:08.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…抱歉  我越来越糊涂了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:09.16", "end": "0:13:09.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "镭射？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:10.19", "end": "0:13:10.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:10.80", "end": "0:13:11.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这真是令人吃惊啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 210, "start": "0:13:13.01", "end": "0:13:13.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能给我看下吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:15.44", "end": "0:13:17.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了是块普通镜片外  看不出什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:18.30", "end": "0:13:19.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是怎么回事啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:20.72", "end": "0:13:22.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能给我看下你右手的手掌吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 214, "start": "0:13:24.57", "end": "0:13:27.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不是你的  是长门同学的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 215, "start": "0:13:38.76", "end": "0:13:40.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突破了防御壁  变成这样了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 216, "start": "0:13:40.91", "end": "0:13:43.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别说的那么平静啊  看起来就好痛啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 217, "start": "0:13:44.01", "end": "0:13:46.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "非常强力  一闪即逝"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 218, "start": "0:13:46.86", "end": "0:13:50.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "镭射光线是从朝比奈学姐的左眼里射出来的吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 219, "start": "0:13:51.22", "end": "0:13:51.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 220, "start": "0:13:52.18", "end": "0:13:53.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对…你个头啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 221, "start": "0:13:54.11", "end": "0:13:55.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "马上修正"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:00.71", "end": "0:14:01.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是怎么回事啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:02.62", "end": "0:14:05.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐真的从眼睛里射出光束了吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:05.85", "end": "0:14:08.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那不是粒子加速炮  是凝集光"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:08.99", "end": "0:14:09.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个都行啦"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:10.28", "end": "0:14:14.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是镭射是镁射还是原子热线炮  在外行人眼里都是一样的东西"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:10.28", "end": "0:14:14.64", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（注:原文为マ—カラィトフア—プ\n为东宝电影「魔斯拉」中，为了攻击魔斯拉的茧所使用的武器）"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:15.42", "end": "0:14:19.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "问题是朝比奈学姐能放出热线这回事吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:19.97", "end": "0:14:22.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是热线  是光子镭射"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:23.01", "end": "0:14:25.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都说了  是哪个都行啦  那种科学称呼"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:26.47", "end": "0:14:29.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是朝比奈学姐原来就有的机能吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:30.35", "end": "0:14:34.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有  现在的朝比奈实玖瑠是个普通人类"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 233, "start": "0:14:35.27", "end": "0:14:37.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以个体而言  和一般人没什么差别"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 234, "start": "0:14:38.52", "end": "0:14:41.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个镜片有什么奥秘吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 235, "start": "0:14:41.44", "end": "0:14:43.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有  只是个装饰品"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 236, "start": "0:14:44.20", "end": "0:14:45.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样的话"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 237, "start": "0:14:45.77", "end": "0:14:47.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是长门没有挡住的话"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 238, "start": "0:14:48.28", "end": "0:14:52.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从朝比奈学姐眼睛里射出的镭射光线就会穿过摄影机的镜头"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 239, "start": "0:14:52.87", "end": "0:14:56.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "连我的眼球一起贯穿  再将其它的东西一起烧掉"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 240, "start": "0:14:57.27", "end": "0:14:59.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从我后脑勺穿出吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 241, "start": "0:14:59.92", "end": "0:15:01.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是凉宫同学搞的鬼吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:02.42", "end": "0:15:04.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为她想着要有「实玖瑠光束」"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:05.06", "end": "0:15:06.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是现实发生了变化"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:07.33", "end": "0:15:08.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这么回事"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:08.51", "end": "0:15:12.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等下啊  那个镜片什么魔法都没附着吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:12.61", "end": "0:15:15.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日这么期望的时候  为什么会射出杀人光线啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:16.65", "end": "0:15:21.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "魔法啊  未知的技术什么的  对于凉宫同学是不需要的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:21.94", "end": "0:15:25.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要她想有  那就有了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:25.66", "end": "0:15:28.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日也不会真的想射出光束啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 250, "start": "0:15:29.24", "end": "0:15:29.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 251, "start": "0:15:30.79", "end": "0:15:34.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们知道凉宫同学是个有常识的人"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 252, "start": "0:15:34.32", "end": "0:15:38.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但这个世界的常识对她无效  这也是事实"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 253, "start": "0:15:39.22", "end": "0:15:42.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次  应该有什么特别的现象在工作吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 254, "start": "0:15:43.01", "end": "0:15:46.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…哦  她们回来了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 255, "start": "0:15:47.62", "end": "0:15:49.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这话题先留到之后再说吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 256, "start": "0:15:50.41", "end": "0:15:53.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要扭扭捏捏到什么时候啊  给我有点女演员的样子"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 257, "start": "0:15:54.07", "end": "0:15:57.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "干脆地脱光衣服是通往蓝带赏的捷径啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 258, "start": "0:16:00.16", "end": "0:16:00.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 259, "start": "0:16:05.39", "end": "0:16:06.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "放——大！"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 260, "start": "0:16:07.96", "end": "0:16:10.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确认结束  确实是我的朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 261, "start": "0:16:11.48", "end": "0:16:12.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在干什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:17.44", "end": "0:16:19.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我指示以外的东西不能拍啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:20.43", "end": "0:16:22.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了  证据就是——"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:22.76", "end": "0:16:25.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我并没有按下录像键  只不过在偷看而已"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:26.34", "end": "0:16:29.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好好  大家注意  然后准备好"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 266, "start": "0:16:39.09", "end": "0:16:43.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后拍摄的是  朝比奈实玖瑠的日常生活影像"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 267, "start": "0:16:44.70", "end": "0:16:45.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是什么样的日常啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 268, "start": "0:16:51.56", "end": "0:16:54.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后朝比奈学姐悲惨地被命令来命令去"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 269, "start": "0:16:58.27", "end": "0:17:01.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以山做背景的话  要怎么找卖点呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 270, "start": "0:17:01.83", "end": "0:17:02.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们上街去吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:06.40", "end": "0:17:07.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…真是的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:13.00", "end": "0:17:16.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这天  直到太阳下山为止朝比奈学姐都穿着兔女郎装"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:18.81", "end": "0:17:20.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要说做了什么的话"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:20.71", "end": "0:17:23.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概就是穿着这么身衣服走来走去罢了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 275, "start": "0:17:26.10", "end": "0:17:29.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日可没什么摄影许可之类的概念"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 276, "start": "0:17:29.90", "end": "0:17:32.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在哪里拍什么可是春日的自由"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 277, "start": "0:17:33.34", "end": "0:17:39.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Innocentius"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:33.34", "end": "0:17:39.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而这种自由就像英诺森三世时代的罗马教皇般难以动摇"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:40.40", "end": "0:17:41.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像是这样"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 280, "start": "0:17:44.58", "end": "0:17:46.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她误解了自由的意义"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 281, "start": "0:17:51.67", "end": "0:17:52.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就这样吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 282, "start": "0:17:55.34", "end": "0:17:56.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是漫长的一天啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 283, "start": "0:17:57.23", "end": "0:17:59.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天星期日真想好好休息啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 284, "start": "0:17:59.87", "end": "0:18:01.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么明天再见了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:01.48", "end": "0:18:03.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "集合时间地点和今天一样就好了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:04.16", "end": "0:18:07.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是不知厌倦的家伙  你给我们准备好调休了吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:08.15", "end": "0:18:10.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是什么啊  摄影已经落后了啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:10.61", "end": "0:18:12.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可没时间悠闲地休息啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:13.12", "end": "0:18:16.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "文化祭结束后随意休息不就好了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:16.68", "end": "0:18:19.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你就当在那之前日历上没红字的日子吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:20.05", "end": "0:18:23.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么明天见  我绝对会让这影片成功的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:24.00", "end": "0:18:28.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  我做导演的话等于说已经和成功约好了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:29.02", "end": "0:18:31.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剩下的就要看你们的努力了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:32.13", "end": "0:18:35.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要按时来啊  迟到的人我要动用私刑再处以死刑"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:42.12", "end": "0:18:44.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我会转达给朝比奈学姐的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 296, "start": "0:18:44.91", "end": "0:18:46.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要转达什么啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 297, "start": "0:18:46.66", "end": "0:18:48.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之前镭射的事情啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 298, "start": "0:18:48.84", "end": "0:18:51.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "眼睛的颜色不变的话  也不会射出奇怪的光线"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 299, "start": "0:18:52.07", "end": "0:18:55.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以防万一  做一个保险吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 300, "start": "0:18:56.65", "end": "0:18:58.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她应该会协助吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 301, "start": "0:18:59.53", "end": "0:19:01.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "毕竟  光束那么危险"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 302, "start": "0:19:08.31", "end": "0:19:08.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么说来"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 303, "start": "0:19:11.76", "end": "0:19:14.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的命尽是长门救回来的啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 304, "start": "0:19:23.34", "end": "0:19:25.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  阿虚  这和你说的不一样啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 305, "start": "0:19:26.04", "end": "0:19:27.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "漂亮的朝比奈学姐在哪里啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 306, "start": "0:19:28.11", "end": "0:19:32.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听你说她会来接我们才来的啊  不是没人吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 307, "start": "0:19:32.43", "end": "0:19:35.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可是来养眼的啊  那要怎么办啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:32.92", "end": "0:19:35.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在说什么啊  你可是主角啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:35.76", "end": "0:19:39.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这电影的成功有30%可是你的哎"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 310, "start": "0:19:39.39", "end": "0:19:42.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天除了凉宫暴怒的表情之外还什么都没看到啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 311, "start": "0:19:43.05", "end": "0:19:43.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这是欺诈啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 312, "start": "0:19:44.23", "end": "0:19:45.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这个扎基去死吧"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 313, "start": "0:19:45.65", "end": "0:19:46.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看看长门也不错啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 314, "start": "0:19:47.53", "end": "0:19:48.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "话说  长门同学"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 315, "start": "0:19:48.98", "end": "0:19:50.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这打扮还真适合啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 316, "start": "0:19:50.92", "end": "0:19:53.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  实玖瑠怎么了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 317, "start": "0:19:54.57", "end": "0:19:57.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看样子  鹤屋学姐也作为临时演员被强行租借过来了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 318, "start": "0:19:58.60", "end": "0:20:00.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对了  你们在干什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:00.36", "end": "0:20:02.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她说要是空的话就来吧  我就来了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 320, "start": "0:20:02.74", "end": "0:20:05.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学手臂上的臂章写的是什么？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 321, "start": "0:20:06.01", "end": "0:20:07.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个摄影机是做什么的？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 322, "start": "0:20:07.99", "end": "0:20:09.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希那身打扮是什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 323, "start": "0:20:10.07", "end": "0:20:12.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇  一树今天好帅呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 324, "start": "0:20:13.21", "end": "0:20:14.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用操心的家伙"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 325, "start": "0:20:14.59", "end": "0:20:17.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么  肚子痛？"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 326, "start": "0:20:17.58", "end": "0:20:21.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笨蛋  那种借口只到小学还有用"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 327, "start": "0:20:21.90", "end": "0:20:23.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "马上给我过来  30秒之内"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 328, "start": "0:20:24.36", "end": "0:20:28.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看样子  朝比奈学姐患了突发性的家里蹲群候症"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 329, "start": "0:20:29.23", "end": "0:20:32.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  我去接她  这行李借我下"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 330, "start": "0:20:46.70", "end": "0:20:49.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很能了解朝比奈学姐的心情呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 331, "start": "0:20:49.87", "end": "0:20:54.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得再这样下去  她真的会变成变身女主角了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 332, "start": "0:20:54.89", "end": "0:20:57.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说  镭射光线也太过分了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 333, "start": "0:20:58.57", "end": "0:21:03.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过  好像可以避免射出奇怪的光线了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:03.78", "end": "0:21:04.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么做"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:06.94", "end": "0:21:08.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我让长门同学协助了下"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 336, "start": "0:21:10.56", "end": "0:21:12.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你对朝比奈学姐做了什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 337, "start": "0:21:13.45", "end": "0:21:15.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是让镭射线消失而已"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 338, "start": "0:21:15.87", "end": "0:21:17.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也不是很清楚"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 339, "start": "0:21:18.16", "end": "0:21:22.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门同学跟其他的TFEI终端机不同  完全不说话呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 340, "start": "0:21:23.44", "end": "0:21:24.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "TFEI是什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 341, "start": "0:21:26.13", "end": "0:21:31.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是我们擅自取的简称  不是什么非知道不可的东西"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 342, "start": "0:21:32.17", "end": "0:21:39.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过我觉得  长门同学在「他们」当中也是大放异彩的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 343, "start": "0:21:46.23", "end": "0:21:47.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之前的那件事啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 344, "start": "0:21:48.31", "end": "0:21:51.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我晚上去便利店回来的路上和出租车擦身而过"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 345, "start": "0:21:53.56", "end": "0:21:58.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "结果我扫了眼出租车的「空车」灯好像变成了「爱车」"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 346, "start": "0:21:59.76", "end": "0:22:01.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那还真是吓一跳呢"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:01.74", "end": "0:22:04.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但等我看清楚前  出租车就走了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 348, "start": "0:22:05.34", "end": "0:22:10.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那时我发现  我目前欠缺的不就是爱吗"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 349, "start": "0:22:11.66", "end": "0:22:14.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不是真的写着「爱车」啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 350, "start": "0:22:15.06", "end": "0:22:16.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那一定是私家出租车"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 351, "start": "0:22:18.17", "end": "0:22:21.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是这两个笨蛋遇不到女性的话…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 352, "start": "0:22:24.20", "end": "0:22:28.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "装病什么的可不行啊  抓紧拍摄了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 353, "start": "0:22:30.85", "end": "0:22:31.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哟呵  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 354, "start": "0:22:32.17", "end": "0:22:34.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇  好loli"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 355, "start": "0:22:35.40", "end": "0:22:36.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "迟到了真是抱歉"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 356, "start": "0:22:37.20", "end": "0:22:38.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊不  我倒无所谓了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 357, "start": "0:22:39.35", "end": "0:22:40.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呐呐  凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 358, "start": "0:22:41.29", "end": "0:22:47.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "昨天真是抱歉  我好像在不知情的情况下发射了光学兵器"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 359, "start": "0:22:47.10", "end": "0:22:49.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪里哪里  反正我也没受伤"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 360, "start": "0:22:56.86", "end": "0:22:58.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我被咬了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 361, "start": "0:22:58.48", "end": "0:22:59.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 362, "start": "0:22:59.79", "end": "0:23:03.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "被长门同学注入了纳米机械之类的"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 363, "start": "0:23:04.08", "end": "0:23:06.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过好像眼睛里不会再射出什么了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 364, "start": "0:23:07.09", "end": "0:23:07.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太好了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 365, "start": "0:23:08.35", "end": "0:23:09.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "注入了什么"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 366, "start": "0:23:10.46", "end": "0:23:14.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "昨天她和古泉同学一起来了我家…"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 367, "start": "0:23:14.10", "end": "0:23:16.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们在说什么秘密话题啊"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 368, "start": "0:23:16.66", "end": "0:23:19.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠真是可爱啊  可爱到想把你养在家里呐"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 369, "start": "0:23:20.33", "end": "0:23:21.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别看  少块肉该怎么办"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 370, "start": "0:23:22.19", "end": "0:23:23.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "场所已经决定了"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 371, "start": "0:23:24.38", "end": "0:23:27.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉家附近好像有个很大的池子"}
{"ep": "22", "idx": 372, "start": "0:23:28.48", "end": "0:23:30.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天我们就姑且从那边拍摄吧"}
